/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Every year 30 million tons of spent grain are produced in breweries all over the world. The sad news: the majority of this great resource is simply thrown away! Our mission: we recycle the valuable spent grain into healthy foods, putting an end to this food waste! We are the "TREBEREI," the 14-member team of the Junior Company at BG/BRG Stainach. We offer THE innovative and sustainable product that no pasta shelf should do without: spent grain pasta!)
/E (Every year 30 million tons of spent grain are produced in breweries all over the world. The sad news: the majority of this great resource is simply thrown away! Our mission: we recycle the valuable spent grain into healthy foods, putting an end to this food waste! We are the "TREBEREI," the 14-member team of the Junior Company at BG/BRG Stainach. We offer THE innovative and sustainable product that no pasta shelf should do without: spent grain pasta!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
