/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (We are rethinking conventional pasta! We start where brewing ends. By using our ingenious raw material we have created a unique product. Our spent grain pasta is the sustainable and delicious solution to recycle the excess by-product from the brewing process into valuable food and make an important contribution to recycling management. Our pasta comes in different varieties at market prices. Spent grain pasta is a healthy protein and fiber marvel!)
/E (We are rethinking conventional pasta! We start where brewing ends. By using our ingenious raw material we have created a unique product. Our spent grain pasta is the sustainable and delicious solution to recycle the excess by-product from the brewing process into valuable food and make an important contribution to recycling management. Our pasta comes in different varieties at market prices. Spent grain pasta is a healthy protein and fiber marvel!)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
