/S /H3
/T (Our marketing team, led by Valerie Auer, Hanna Lemmerer, Liana Mamikonyan, and Felix Holzer, tirelessly strives to inform our target audience about the quality, sustainability, and uniqueness of our products through both traditional and digital media channels. With a great deal of creative energy and dedication, the team embodies our motto: "Nobody can resist the ingenious products of Treberei!")
