252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Our market analysis, which was conducted in three local supermarkets before entering the market, revealed significant interest in our products. Particularly important to the respondents were the following points: 34% emphasized the importance of regional sourcing, while another 24% prioritized sustainability. Additionally, the high protein and fiber content provided added value for 65% of respondents. In another survey conducted during our opening event, where 96% of participants belonged to our main target audience, 100% indicated that they would recommend our products.)
/E (Our market analysis, which was conducted in three local supermarkets before entering the market, revealed significant interest in our products. Particularly important to the respondents were the following points: 34% emphasized the importance of regional sourcing, while another 24% prioritized sustainability. Additionally, the high protein and fiber content provided added value for 65% of respondents. In another survey conducted during our opening event, where 96% of participants belonged to our main target audience, 100% indicated that they would recommend our products.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [14]
>>
